<title>USA: TENNIS-U.S. PRO CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. PRO CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $303,000 U.S.</p>
<p>Pro Tennis Championships at the Longwood Cricket Club on</p>
<p>Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>2-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 6-7 (1-7)</p>
<p>6-2 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat 7-Magnus Norman (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-3 6-7 (5-7) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Galo Blanco (Spain) beat 8-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Johan Van Herck (Belgium) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) 6-1</p>
<p>1-6 6-2</p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) beat Lionel Roux (France) 6-7</p>
<p>(2-7) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
